clause.content:
is not employed by, or participating in the management of, a long-term care facility or a related
 organization, and has not been employed by such a facility or organization
 within 1 year before the date of the determination involved;

does not receive, or have the right to receive, directly or indirectly, remuneration (in cash or in
 kind) under a compensation arrangement with an owner or operator of a
 long-term care facility;
